# 📘 TOEFL Academic Vocabulary - Day33

| Word | Meaning | Example |
|---|---|---|
| maintain | 유지하다 | Plants need water to maintain healthy growth. |
| obtain | 얻다 | Researchers obtained data from several experiments. |
| reveal | 드러내다, 밝히다 | The study revealed an unexpected result. |

---

## Synonyms

### maintain
→ preserve / keep

### obtain
→ acquire / get

### reveal
→ disclose / show

---

## Useful Collocations

maintain stability
→ 안정성을 유지하다

maintain balance
→ 균형을 유지하다

obtain data
→ 데이터를 얻다

obtain information
→ 정보를 얻다

reveal a result
→ 결과를 밝혀내다

